From: NeoTech <andreas@roughedge.se>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 16:21:09 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] fix(test): repair two app tests that went stale on main

docs_troubleshooting read the troubleshooting page at its old path.
PR #1908 moved the page to site/content/guide/reference/ by design.

threaded_batch_matches_the_serial_loop_bit_for_bit used a 20 mm box
stock over a 5 mm cube. The 3D Pocket reach law from #1895 (#1844)
correctly refuses that: uncut stock from Z 5 to 20 stays where the
BN-0600's 8 mm shank (15 mm above the tip) would sit at Bottom Z 0.
The fixture stock now stands to the cube's top, Z 5, as the sibling
shell-switch test does since #96. No production code changed.

Fixes #1924

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
